test.yaml:16:24: "github.event.changes.title.from" is the previous title of an edited issue or pull request, which is not validated and can hold shell syntax. avoid using it directly in inline scripts. instead, pass it through an environment variable. see https://docs.github.com/en/actions/reference/security/secure-use#good-practices-for-mitigating-script-injection-attacks for more details [expression]
